category: Libs
requires: cygwin libarchive13 libcairo2 libcfitsio10 libcgif0 libexif12 libexpat1 libfftw3_3 libfontconfig1 libglib2.0_0 libheif1 libhwy1 libIlmImf2_5_26 libimagequant0 libintl8 libjpeg8 libjxl0.13 liblcms2_2 libMagickCore7_10 libmatio14 libnifti2 libopenjp2_7 libopenslide1 libpango1.0_0 libpng16 libpoppler-glib8 libraw16 librsvg2_2 libtiff7 libuhdr2 libwebp7 libwebpdemux2 libwebpmux3 libznz3 zlib0
sdesc: "Fast image processing library with low memory needs (runtime)"
ldesc: "VIPS is a free image processing system. It is good with large images (images
larger than the amount of RAM you have available), with many CPUs (see
Benchmarks for examples of SMP scaling, VIPS is also part of the PARSEC
suite), for working with colour, for scientific analysis and for general
research & development. As well as JPEG, TIFF and PNG images, it also supports
scientific formats like FITS, Matlab, Analyze, PFM, Radiance and OpenSlide."
external-source: libvips

